      "versionNonce": 1154657967,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785766310831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "content_based.py -> vehicle_to_feature_vector()\n  7 features normalisees:\n    price_norm, year_norm, mileage_norm (StandardScaler)\n    body_type_encoded  -> ordinal 0-1 (9 categories)\n    transmission_encoded -> manuelle=0, semi=0.5, auto=1\n    fuel_encoded -> ordinal 0-1 (7 types)\n    engine_power_norm\n\n  Similarite: cosine_similarity (sklearn)\n  Scalers: StandardScaler + MinMaxScaler (cached lru)",
      "fontSize": 12.062964267820199,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "content_based.py -> vehicle_to_feature_vector()\n  7 features normalisees:\n    price_norm, year_norm, mileage_norm (StandardScaler)\n    body_type_encoded  -> ordinal 0-1 (9 categories)\n    transmission_encoded -> manuelle=0, semi=0.5, auto=1\n    fuel_encoded -> ordinal 0-1 (7 types)\n    engine_power_norm\n\n  Similarite: cosine_similarity (sklearn)\n  Scalers: StandardScaler + MinMaxScaler (cached lru)",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2Z"
