      "updated": 1785766114877,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CORSMiddleware (origins configurables)  |  SecurityHeadersMiddleware (X-Content-Type, X-Frame, HSTS)  |  AuditLogMiddleware (log toutes les requetes)\nSlowAPI Rate Limiter (user_or_ip_key_func)  |  JWT Bearer Auth (access_token + refresh_token)  |  RequestValidationError handler (422 detaille)",
      "fontSize": 13.676252119612336,
      "fontFamily": 1,
